              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kugira, nkë ömöntö aranyoore gukuibhamba ëkëbhara gionsui, na hano atabhute öbhöhoru bhooe? Gösë nkë ömöntö akaruusia kuibhaga riö öbhöhoru bhooe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
